# Tests

- Framework: Vitest unit MUST; Playwright smoke SHOULD (`14`).
- Automate deterministic logic only: persist validate, flatten, effect `t` fixtures, hex parse.
- MUST NOT gate CI on full-canvas pixel diffs / screenshots of LED grid.
- E2E: assert DOM/network (no Google Fonts CDN), not pixel patterns.
- Co-locate `*.test.ts` next to source when possible.
- Map cases to TC/AC ids in `13` / `06` when adding suites.
